/-! # Rational bounds for the scaled group remainders

The eight rational functions `grpValue_*` are expressed in powers of `n - 1024`.
Positive denominator coefficients and coefficientwise inequalities give rational
lower and upper bounds for `n ≥ 1024`, using `rational_integer_coefficients_bound`.
These bounds supply inputs for the signed remainder estimate. Identification with
the analytic group expressions is established separately. -/
